:: Dad Asking PC to be Family Pet Jokingly [nobr]

/* Intro */
You are sitting around, lost in your own mind, when you suddenly feel a hand on your head that begins to pet you. <span style="color:Pink">You feel a pleasant shiver run up your spine and lift up your chin, smiling as your eyes shut and you just take in the relaxing and comforting touch. You hear a chuckle and open one eye to see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> is the one petting you.</span> <br>

	<<set _ad to [
		{
			Name: "Dad",
			State: {
				Mouth: "Happy",
			},
		},
		{
			Name: "Player",
			State: {
				Mouth: "Happy",
                Blush: 1,
			},
		},
	]>>
	<<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Haha, you even react like a dog.”</span> He says, continuing to pet you, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“If you keep walking around wearing those things, I may have to designate you as the family pet.”</span> He jokes, scratching your behind your fox ear as you can’t help but smile. <span style="color:LightGreen">While he may have been kidding, you could definitely get used to this!</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Dad" 1>>
<br>

<<if $Player.Traits.includes("Kitsune")>>
    <span style="color:BlueViolet">Then you realize something, freezing in place and turning to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>. Did he notice your ears and tail? They normally appear invisible to everyone else, as far as you can tell, though in this instance <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> seems to see them as just pieces of a costume. You reckon this is the spirit’s doing, though figure it isn’t a bad thing and just smile as he continues to pet you.</span> <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

